---
// Database Isolation Levels and MVCC Snapshot Mechanisms Diagram
---

<figure class="mvcc-diagram" aria-labelledby="mvcc-caption">
  <svg
    class="mvcc-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="mvcc-title mvcc-desc"
  >
    <title id="mvcc-title">資料庫交易隔離層級與 MVCC 底層快照尋址架構</title>
    <desc id="mvcc-desc">
      展示 ANSI SQL 隔離層級與讀異象防禦矩陣、PostgreSQL Heap Tuple 底層結構
      (xmin/xmax/t_ctid)，以及 Snapshot 快照可見性判定演算法。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="mvcc-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="mvcc-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Isolation Levels & Anomalies -->
    <g class="mvcc-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26"
        >ANSI SQL &amp; PHENOMENA</text
      >
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">交易隔離層級與讀異象</text
      >

      <!-- Tier 1 -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="60"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--dim"></rect>
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__label" x="10" y="20"
          >1. Read Uncommitted</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="10" y="42"
          >允許髒讀 (Dirty Read)，實務極少採用</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Tier 2 -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 145)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="60"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="mvcc-diagram__label mvcc-diagram__label--blue"
          x="10"
          y="20">2. Read Committed (預設)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="10" y="42"
          >防髒讀；每條 SQL 語句獲取獨立快照</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Tier 3 -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 215)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="60"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="mvcc-diagram__label mvcc-diagram__label--purple"
          x="10"
          y="20">3. Repeatable Read</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="10" y="42"
          >防不可重複讀；整筆交易共用初始快照</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Tier 4 -->
      <g transform="translate(18, 285)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="60"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text
          class="mvcc-diagram__label mvcc-diagram__label--gold"
          x="10"
          y="20">4. Serializable (SSI)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="10" y="42"
          >防寫偏斜 (Write Skew)；SIREAD 鎖圖檢測</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Physical Heap Tuple Structure -->
    <g class="mvcc-diagram__card" transform="translate(340, 40)">
      <rect width="280" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">POSTGRES HEAP TUPLE</text>
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54"
        >MVCC 多版本 Tuple 結構</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect width="244" height="70" rx="6" class="mvcc-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >Tuple Header (23 Bytes)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="44"
          >xmin: 建立此版本的 XID</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="60"
          >xmax: 刪除/覆蓋此版本的 XID</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 155)">
        <rect width="244" height="65" rx="6" class="mvcc-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >版本指針鏈 (t_ctid)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="42"
          >指向當前物理位置或最新版本 Tuple</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="58"
          >(block_num, offset_num)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 230)">
        <rect
          width="244"
          height="115"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--orange"></rect>
        <text
          class="mvcc-diagram__header mvcc-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">狀態標記 (t_infomask)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="42"
          >• HEAP_XMIN_COMMITTED</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="62"
          >• HEAP_XMIN_INVALID (Rollback)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• HEAP_XMAX_INVALID (Active Row)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="102"
          >• HEAP_HOT_UPDATED (HOT 鏈)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Snapshot Visibility Engine -->
    <g class="mvcc-diagram__card" transform="translate(660, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">VISIBILITY ENGINE</text>
      <text class="mvcc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">快照可見性判斷演算法</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="mvcc-diagram__subcard mvcc-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="mvcc-diagram__header mvcc-diagram__header--purple"
          x="12"
          y="22">SnapshotData 結構</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="44"
          >xmin: 最小未提交 XID</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="60"
          >xmax: 獲取快照時最大分配 XID + 1</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__code" x="12" y="76"
          >xip_list: 快照瞬間活躍中的 XID 集合</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 170)">
        <rect width="234" height="175" rx="6" class="mvcc-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >可見性判定準則 (xmin)</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="46"
          >1. xmin == 當前 XID ➔ 可見</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="70"
          >2. xmin &lt; Snapshot.xmin ➔ 必定已提交</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="94"
          >3. xmin &gt;= Snapshot.xmax ➔ 視為未來不可見</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="118"
          >4. Snapshot.xmin &lt;= xmin &lt; xmax:</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="24" y="138"
          >若 xmin in xip_list ➔ 活躍中不可見</text
        >
        <text class="mvcc-diagram__subdesc" x="24" y="158"
          >若 xmin not in xip_list ➔ 已提交可見</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Arrows -->
    <path
      d="M 300 220 L 330 220"
      class="mvcc-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#mvcc-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 620 220 L 650 220"
      class="mvcc-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#mvcc-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="mvcc-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="mvcc-mobile-card">
      <span class="mvcc-mobile-badge">ANSI SQL 隔離層級</span>
      <h4>交易隔離層級與讀異象防禦</h4>
      <p>
        <strong>Read Committed:</strong> 語句級快照，防髒讀（Postgres/Oracle 預設）。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Repeatable Read:</strong> 交易級快照，防不可重複讀與幻讀（MySQL 預設）。
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Serializable:</strong> 序列化隔離，透過 SSI 依賴圖防範寫偏斜（Write
        Skew）。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mvcc-mobile-arrow">↓ 底層物理 Tuple 標記</div>

    <div class="mvcc-mobile-card mvcc-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="mvcc-mobile-badge mvcc-mobile-badge--blue">HEAP TUPLE</span>
      <h4>PostgreSQL MVCC 版本結構</h4>
      <p><strong>xmin:</strong> 建立該版本的 Transaction ID。</p>
      <p>
        <strong>xmax:</strong> 刪除或更新該版本的 Transaction ID（若有效為 0）。
      </p>
      <p><strong>t_ctid:</strong> 指向當前 Tuple 或更新版本鏈的物理指標。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mvcc-mobile-arrow">↓ 快照可見性判定</div>

    <div class="mvcc-mobile-card mvcc-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="mvcc-mobile-badge mvcc-mobile-badge--purple"
        >SNAPSHOT DATA</span
      >
      <h4>快照可見性演算法</h4>
      <p>
        依據 <code>xmin:xmax:xip_list</code> 過濾未提交與未來交易，實現高併發讀寫不互斥。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="mvcc-caption" class="mvcc-diagram__caption">
    圖 1：資料庫交易隔離層級、PostgreSQL Heap Tuple 欄位與 MVCC 快照判定架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .mvcc-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__badge {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #1e293b;
    stroke: #334155;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard--dim {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #38bdf8;
    fill: #f0f9ff;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subcard--blue {
    stroke: #0284c7;
    fill: #0c4a6e;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard--purple {
    stroke: #a855f7;
    fill: #faf5ff;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subcard--purple {
    stroke: #7e22ce;
    fill: #3b0764;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard--gold {
    stroke: #fbbf24;
    fill: #fefce8;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subcard--gold {
    stroke: #d97706;
    fill: #451a03;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subcard--orange {
    stroke: #f97316;
    fill: #fff7ed;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subcard--orange {
    stroke: #ea580c;
    fill: #431407;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #334155;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__label {
    fill: #e2e8f0;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__label--blue {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__label--blue {
    fill: #38bdf8;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__label--purple {
    fill: #7e22ce;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__label--purple {
    fill: #c084fc;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__label--gold {
    fill: #b45309;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__label--gold {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__header {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__header {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__header--purple {
    fill: #7e22ce;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__header--purple {
    fill: #c084fc;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #c2410c;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__header--orange {
    fill: #fb923c;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__subdesc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__subdesc {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__code {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #0369a1;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__code {
    fill: #7dd3fc;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__flow-line {
    stroke: #0284c7;
    stroke-width: 2;
    fill: none;
    stroke-dasharray: 4, 4;
  }

  .mvcc-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #0284c7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mvcc-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .mvcc-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--dg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-card {
      background: #0f172a;
      border-color: #1e293b;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-card--blue {
      border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
      background: #f0f9ff;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-card--blue {
      background: #0c4a6e;
      border-color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-card--purple {
      border-left: 4px solid #7e22ce;
      background: #faf5ff;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-card--purple {
      background: #3b0764;
      border-color: #a855f7;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #0284c7;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-badge--blue {
      color: #38bdf8;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #7e22ce;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-badge--purple {
      color: #c084fc;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink);
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-card h4 {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-mobile-card p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .mvcc-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted);
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__flow-line {
    stroke: #4bb3e8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .mvcc-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #4bb3e8;
  }
</style>
